  "description": "v054 EXACTLY with ONE change: model.layers 2 -> 1. The optimiser has never been varied in this project -- across 57 versions lr, weight_decay, grad_clip and schedule were all fixed. This opens that surface. Graded against wunderfund's best config (97 submissions).",
